{"schemaVersion":1,"release":"20261114-evidence2","scope":"Three bounded number-state learning panels, structure-source handoff into explicit representation calculations, and an official Cu thermal-file workflow.","counts":{"oscillatorLessons":3,"oscillatorPlacements":3,"cuInputCellAtoms":4,"cuRows":251},"hooks":{"scattering-temperature":["ladder-weights"],"polaron-hamiltonian":["vacuum-motion"],"polaron-truncation":["finite-boundary"]},"verification":["Independent number-state sums and matrices check amplitudes, probabilities, separately weighted tails, microscopic reverse transitions and finite-boundary commutators against the fixed references and the existing Python API.","Course integration preserves disclosures, unfinished responses, notes and original calculator drafts; explicit copying preserves the exact chosen temperature and waits for manual calculation.","Strict source metadata preserves file/text hash identity, tolerances, basis/origin and wavevector transforms and single/double-valued selection through workbench export and explicitly saved research records. Changed requests cannot inherit unrelated source metadata.","Official Cu source bytes, lossless XZ decompression, input-cell normalization and all thermal rows are checked. Import loading, replacement, cancellation and stale completion are exercised through actual form handlers."],"boundaries":["Fixed teaching references do not introduce a general oscillator or scattering solver. Holstein vacuum and numerical truncation panels do not infer a finite-temperature polaron state.","A source checksum identifies the parsed source; it is not an electronic-structure calculation or magnetic-order detector. Imported metadata cannot independently reverify absent original bytes. Numerical representation validity and standard-label coverage remain separate.","Cu thermal_properties data describe one official calculated four-atom input cell at one volume. They do not supply eigenvectors, measured data, full quasi-harmonic volume predictions or a newly performed material calculation.","This release covers three learning hooks and representative source workflows. Broader curriculum depth, diagnosis and authentic workflows for every tool family remain open."],"files":{"GOAL-ROADMAP.md":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":42525,"sha256":"7615f84979e3db76c7bfe22c79cfde64f04ba1f0d1d8b7a2a8392ec838de07e2"},"dist/app.js":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":97887,"sha256":"b8af832a30dea608453a074cd6e245b7100ec51f2fe73a418c2bfdcd2a70d762"},"dist/bridges-ui.js":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":17161,"sha256":"ebe3e132b5f21d4a18d801363df54b0b56be907aff2a971aa7bb0708152f888f"},"dist/data/examples/phonopy-cu-LICENSE.txt":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":1470,"sha256":"2ce26839c8b70d28765d73e934cc1a979d896d8d228d30694fdd9a92e94d43a9"},"dist/data/examples/phonopy-cu-thermal-index05.yaml":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":41975,"sha256":"1c9e6edeeded194fc7eebe9c4f4bd6e88728b48ea4f530a033240f8394267bf1"},"dist/data/examples/phonopy-cu-thermal-index05.yaml.xz":{"normalization":"raw-bytes","bytes":4900,"sha256":"36c87fc5560cc7815cd9d97105830c00cffa4a3a2fb486235d7976bc493ebb1f"},"dist/data/examples/phonopy-cu-thermal-source.json":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":2907,"sha256":"903330e565a126b3e8d30b09099ce1a352fbf0703c9d98e4cf2344e56941763f"},"dist/docs/cu-thermal-example.md":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":4040,"sha256":"69155f09dba2ab02a9a59e71a7f55b2a16ebf5bf177b295c1144eb892027a017"},"dist/index.html":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":7409,"sha256":"9bf58bffaed6d7a68ac7aca48e325c9bffd2684aebae9790e460f85b7df905ad"},"dist/learning-bridge-host.js":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":4616,"sha256":"b549c0f3268b4ccf3b2e801bf6a5cb91d2be1a666903fb0e03b70f26467b70e8"},"dist/material-notebook.js":{"normalization":"utf8-lf-v1","bytes":24774,"sha256":"c11ef3f8ff51255704d211e7332f529c5cc3448e0ead74b4a1ff5a1ed39134e3"},"dist/material-research-ui.js":{"normalization":"utf